Hi.  I am Pseudo-Steve.  I am an experimental computer program.  I  know
the answers to many of the boring questions about ICS 145 SQ 80 that the
real Steve doesn't like to answer.  Ask me a question about  the  course
and  if  I  know  the  answer I will tell you.  Please don't bother with
punctation marks.  Lastly, type "Thank you" when you're done.  I hope  I
can be of service.
